sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant ASGI as ASGI Server
    participant FastAPI
    participant Starlette
    participant Middleware
    participant router
    participant Controller
    participant Service
    participant Manager

    Note over ASGI,router: Framework
    Note over Controller,Manager: Galaxy Backend

    Browser->>+ASGI: TCP/IP Request
    Note left of Browser: Static content<br>CSS, JS, Image
    ASGI-->>-Browser: 

    Browser->>+ASGI: TCP/IP Request
    ASGI->>+FastAPI: asgi args
    FastAPI->>+Starlette: asgi args
    Starlette->>+Middleware: asgi args
    Middleware->>+router: asgi args
    router->>+Controller: pydantic
    Controller->>+Service: pydantic
    Service->>+Manager: pydantic

    Note left of Browser: API Request
    Note right of Manager: Vanilla Python function calls.<br>Use application components<br>to perform "business logic"

    Manager-->>-Service: pydantic
    Service-->>-Controller: pydantic
    Controller-->>-router: pydantic
    router-->>-Middleware: 
    Middleware-->>-Starlette: 
    Starlette-->>-FastAPI: 
    FastAPI-->>-ASGI: 
    ASGI-->>-Browser: 
